Title: "ODH Occupations"
Description: """
This value set identifies occupations relevant to occupational data for health, using codes from the [International Standard Classification of Occupations (ISCO-08)](https://ilostat.ilo.org/methods/concepts-and-definitions/classification-occupation/) published by the International Labour Organization (ILO).
"""
